Output docs/media/credweave-demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1500
Set Height 900
Set TypingSpeed 18ms
Set Padding 18

Type "python3 credweave.py examples/sample-ntdsdump.txt --bloodhound examples/sample-bloodhound.zip --potfile examples/sample.pot --cracked-t0 --uncracked-t0 --width 130"
Enter
Sleep 8s
